    "chunk_text": "Pariah States Creating Hell On Earth\n\nMost people with a conscience have been deeply distressed by the global hegemon\u2019s and apartheid settler colony\u2019s military assault on the population of Iran. Many people of Sri Lankan origin had not bothered to study the history of the plight of oppressed Middle Eastern peoples until the brave military operation by the Axis of Resistance accelerating since late 2023.\n\nIllegality, false narratives and creation of myths via Western mainstream media continue to hold sway despite valiant efforts from all humanitarian and rights groups to counter them. Analyse the background of the Zionist apartheid state; one issue is the Right of Return for any Jew who can prove his ancestry.\n\nWithin two years of the ethno-supremacist Zionist state calling itself Israel being proclaimed in the Knesset, \u2018The Law of Return\u2019 was established, a law which allows any Jew around the world to migrate to Israel and automatically become citizens, developing illegal settlements with impunity. In 1952, the Knesset passed the Citizenship Law, which effectively bars any Palestinian not living in Israel from returning and reclaiming their former property from the colonisers.\n\nIn the distribution of land resources, the glaring injustice is just as blatant. Over ninety per cent of the Palestinian community in Israel desperately hold on to less than three per cent of their land, mostly in their towns and villages, after waves of confiscation by the Zionist state which forcibly expropriated more than two-thirds of their land.\n\nThis confiscated land is kept in trust for illegal, armed Jewish settlers and for Jews around the globe, who might one day want to become citizens. Palestinians living in Israel cannot claim back land illegally taken from them, under the aegis of the Absentee Property Law of 1950. Most Sri Lankans are unaware of this background."
