    "description": "Siam City Cement signs MoU to boost engineering skills in Southern Province",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Siam-City-Cement-signs-MoU-to-boost-engineering-skills-in-Southern-Province/34-791201",
    "lang": "en",
